# CVEs accepted as risks, one per line. Trivy skips these when gating.
#
# Only add an ID here with a reason and a date. An ignore file with no
# explanation is how a known-vulnerable image reaches production.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-2024-12345   # reason, who decided, when to revisit
#
# Nothing is ignored right now, which is the correct starting state.
